### GET All items Happy Path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### GET All items Bed credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin1 admin
Accept: application/json

###

### GET one items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

###### CREATE one item
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "name4",
  "description": "d4"
}

###

### GET one item Not Found (тест на неіснуючий id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/999
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### UPDATE an item (оновлення існуючого елемента)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "updatedName2",
  "description": "updatedDesc2"
}

###

### DELETE an item (видалення елемента за id)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

### CREATE one item Unauthorized (спроба створення без логіна/пароля)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "name5",
  "description": "d5"
}

###

### GET one item Unauthorized (спроба отримати елемент без авторизації)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Accept: application/json

###









